# Public corpora (M1.36) are fetched into a cache OUTSIDE the checkout and never committed; xtask
# refuses a cache inside the repo. These lines are the second lock (and `xtask ci-guards` fails
# if they disappear or if a tracked file looks like dataset bytes). The private golden set (B21)
# never lives in this repository either.
/corpus-cache/
/corpora/
/datasets/
/golden/
